---
const rawBase = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const base = rawBase.endsWith('/') ? rawBase : `${rawBase}/`;
const href = `${base}taiwan-universities/`;
---
<section class="domestic-university-entry" aria-labelledby="domestic-university-title">
  <div class="domestic-university-copy">
    <div class="kicker">TAIWAN UNIVERSITY &amp; MAJOR EXPLORER</div>
    <h2 id="domestic-university-title">國內大學選校選系資料庫</h2>
    <p>70 所大學、193 個科系深度頁，整合課程特色、研究與就業方向，以及 70 校學生網路評價摘要。官方資料與學生觀察分開呈現。</p>
    <a class="button button-primary" href={href}>進入國內大學選校選系資料庫 →</a>
  </div>
  <div class="domestic-university-numbers" aria-label="資料庫規模">
    <div><strong>70</strong><span>所大學</span></div>
    <div><strong>193</strong><span>科系深度頁</span></div>
    <div><strong>70</strong><span>校學生評價</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .domestic-university-entry{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.45fr) minmax(270px,.55fr);
    gap:34px;
    margin:30px 0 38px;
    padding:30px 0;
    border-top:3px double var(--line-dark);
    border-bottom:3px double var(--line-dark);
  }
  .domestic-university-copy h2{
    margin:7px 0 10px;
    font-family:Georgia,"Noto Serif TC",serif;
    font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.5vw,3rem);
    line-height:1.1;
  }
  .domestic-university-copy p{max-width:720px;margin:0 0 18px;color:#565149;font-size:1rem}
  .domestic-university-numbers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);align-self:stretch;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--sheet)}
  .domestic-university-numbers div{display:flex;min-width:0;padding:17px 10px;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
  .domestic-university-numbers div:last-child{border-right:0}
  .domestic-university-numbers strong{font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;font-size:2.3rem;line-height:1;color:var(--burgundy)}
  .domestic-university-numbers span{margin-top:7px;color:var(--muted);font-family:Arial,"Noto Sans TC",sans-serif;font-size:.69rem;line-height:1.3}
  @media(max-width:820px){.domestic-university-entry{grid-template-columns:1fr}.domestic-university-numbers{max-width:520px}}
  @media(max-width:520px){.domestic-university-numbers strong{font-size:1.8rem}.domestic-university-numbers span{font-size:.62rem}}
</style>